## Previously raised findings (review-round registry)

These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F1 | open | IMPORTANT | lib/src/compaction/structured/engine.dart | ⚠️ important the escalation ladder still has a post verdict append refresh report window this diff swaps the escalation s entry check to ladderterminated — but unlike the other four ladders the escalation got no post append guard so a kill landing mid append still produces exactly the 2258 two writer residue this pr closes everywhere else runescalationfold samples totalbudgetspent once before the append engine dart 1226 if cancelbudget lands after that sample — during await appendescalationcheckpoint engine dart 1255 or between the fold s return and the refresh — the success return carries no terminal re check the failed append branch does re check runcancelled the success branch checks nothing runcheckpointescalationpass then unconditionally runs refreshstate engine dart 1181 and emits an ok true escalation receipt — state messages rebuilt over the full session projection after the factory s timedout verdict the in memory context trimmed locally marker dropped a success pass reported post verdict this contradicts the gate s own contract here a ladder that lost the race to the factory s verdict must not append session records refresh state messages … or report a pass and the pre existing gh 204 semantic 7 doc on this very method no append and no report after it whether the in flight call died with the budget or raced it — the current code enforces it only for the pre append sample fix mirror the other ladders in runescalationfold re check ladderterminated after the append and surface it as a budgetspent written but unprojected outcome in runcheckpointescalationpass bail before refreshstate emit when ladderterminated not 🚨 because the wide windows ac1 ac2 cover judge summarizer hang are genuinely fixed and this is a narrow mid append race on an otherwise untouched flow — but it is a real correctness gap against the pr s stated one gate all callers invariant in a function this diff touches |
| F2 | open | SUGGESTION | test/compaction/structured_budget_kill_test.dart | 🪶 nit file is not dart format clean contradicts the pr description s claim dart format dart 3 14 within the repo s 3 12 0 4 0 0 constraint reflows lines 353 355 to the 2 line form dart final src io file lib src compaction structured engine dart readasstringsync the pr description claims dart format exact on both touched files — that holds for engine dart but not for this file there is no ci format gate format is enforced only as the pre commit self heal so this is style only run dart format test compaction structured budget kill test dart before merge |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

